<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Water_models">Water models</span></h2>
<p>Water planes can be tilted, but they are constrained to remain flat and rectangular. This can prevent certain types of water usage, for example a water plane can't simulate a fast-flowing forest brook very well.
</p><p>For these purposes a custom <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Model" title="Model">model</a> may be needed. Existing examples include:
</p>
